OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAnother very warm, dry and
OL,6,Flargely sunny day, occasionally hazy
OL,7,Fdue to higher cloud, most likely later
OL,8,Fin the day. Turning breezy especially
OL,9,Falong eastern coasts.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FGradually turning cloudier
OL,12,Ffrom the west with the odd shower
OL,13,Fpossible by the morning. Rather breezy
OL,14,Fat times. Another warm night.
OL,15,
OL,16,CSunday:FA cooler day to come on Sunday
OL,17,Fwith a mix of sunny spells and
OL,18,Fshowers, these may turn heavy at
OL,19,Ftimes. Often rather breezy, if not
OL,20,Fwindy around exposed areas.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
