OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FMostly
OL,6,Fdry into the new week with lots of
OL,7,Fsunshine. Temperatures gradually
OL,8,Fincreasing again, day by day, with
OL,9,Fanother hot spell to come.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
